OL,3,CMan arrested after four people,
OL,4,Cincluding baby girl, killed in A38
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FA man has been arrested after four
OL,8,Fpeople, including a baby girl, were
OL,9,Fkilled when a car left the A38 near
OL,10,FDerby and crashed into trees.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,13,Fstretch between the A50 Toyota Island
OL,14,Fand the A516 at around 11pm on
OL,15,FSaturday 25 July.
OL,17,FDerbyshire Police said a red Hyundai,
OL,18,Fcarrying five people, had left the
OL,19,Fcarriageway.
