OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785104278
OL,3,CMan arrested after four people,
OL,4,Cincluding baby girl, killed in A38
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FTwo women, aged 18 and 30, and a 36-
OL,8,Fyear-old man were pronounced dead at
OL,9,Fthe scene.
OL,11,FA baby girl was taken to hospital but
OL,12,Fdied a short time later.
OL,14,FAll four were passengers in the car
OL,15,Fand were from Leeds in West Yorkshire.
OL,17,FThe driver, a 33-year-old man, was
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital with serious
OL,19,Finjuries and remains there.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
