FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785104278
OL,3,CMan arrested after four people,
OL,4,Cincluding baby girl, killed in A38
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FHe has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,10,FThe victims' relatives have been
OL,11,Finformed and are being supported by
OL,12,Fspecialist officers.
OL,14,FThe A38 was closed for several hours
OL,15,Fwhile emergency services dealt with
OL,16,Fthe crash but has since reopened.
OL,18,FPolice are appealing for witnesses and
OL,19,Fwant to hear from anyone with dashcam
OL,20,Ffootage that may have captured the
OL,21,Fincident.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/3
